p Dear #{@user.decorate.full_name},
p The following scoring is ready for #{@review_stage} and requires your action.

p Project: #{@score_approval.project.name}
p Campaign: #{@score_approval.campaign.name}
p Assessment: #{@score_approval.assessment.name}
p Candidate: #{@score_approval.subject.decorate.full_name}

p You are receiving this email because you have been added as the #{@review_role} for this scoring.

p You can access the scoring approval via the following link:

= link_to 'Scoring Approval', @url
